"Modpack" means a curated collection of Minecraft mods distributed for use
together, including its configuration files and its server pack.


YOU MAY

  1. Download the mod and use it, privately or on a server of any size.

  2. Include the mod in a modpack, public or private, free or paid, provided
     the modpack credits "Iron Oak" and links to
     https://github.com/mini-mammoth/iron-oak

  3. Distribute the mod file, unmodified, as part of such a modpack -
     including bundled inside a client or server pack.

  4. Read, study, and fork this source code, and open pull requests against
     the original repository.

  5. Write, publish, and sell add-ons, patches, or resource packs that depend
     on this mod, without those works becoming subject to this license.

  6. Distribute translations of the mod's language files by contributing them
     back to the original repository.


YOU MAY NOT

  1. Distribute the mod, modified or unmodified, as a standalone download or
     as a mirror, outside of a modpack as permitted above.

  2. Publish a fork of this mod as a separate project or under a different
     name.

  3. Remove or alter this license, the copyright notice, or the mod's
     attribution, or present the mod as your own work.


